# bat configuration — deployed by the bat/ stow package.
# Theme is pinned statically (no theme engine): the Catppuccin Mocha .tmTheme
# is vendored alongside this file in ./themes/. bat only registers a custom
# theme after `bat cache --build` runs once; shellSetup's install_cli_tools
# does that after this package is stowed. BAT_THEME in .zshrc selects it.
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"
--style="numbers,changes,header"
--italic-text=always
